OL,3,GNEWSANo happy ending after otter
OL,4,Acaptured in Aberdeenshire town
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn otter that was captured after
OL,7,Frunning loose in a small Aberdeenshire
OL,8,Ftown has been euthanised because it was
OL,9,Fjudged too unwell to recover and
OL,10,Fsurvive.
OL,12,FFootage posted on social media shows
OL,13,Fpolice officers becoming involved in
OL,14,Fthe operation to help the mammal which
OL,15,Fhad been cantering down a road in
OL,16,FInverurie.
OL,18,FA police van could be seen swerving to
OL,19,Fa halt and an officer jumped out to
OL,20,Fcontain it in a garden before animal
OL,21,Frescuers arrived with a net.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
