OL,3,GNEWSANo happy ending after otter
OL,4,Acaptured in Aberdeenshire town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe otter was later examined by a vet
OL,7,Fwho found it was injured and nearing
OL,8,Fthe end of its natural life and a
OL,9,Fdecision was taken to put it to sleep
OL,10,Fhumanely.
